# update vs copier update

`update` / `devenv update` refresh **your** `devenv.lock` and optional
`update.local.sh`. Template tools (RTK, Serena, Headroom, 9Router, MCP
pins, debtmap, vendored `.agents/skills/`) move only with `copier update`.

```
# ❌ BAD — fighting the next copier update
# modules/non-nix/catalog.json
"pin": "9.9.9"

# ✅ GOOD
copier update
# or bump *your* extras in gitignored update.local.sh
```

Do not edit `modules/non-nix/catalog.json` pins (or generated `mise.toml`)
to "upgrade" the stack. `devenv update` is the devenv CLI (flake inputs).
`update` is our script; it does not wrap that CLI.
